                            <comment id="16206116" author="alexey.tank2" created="Mon, 16 Oct 2017 16:10:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There are 3 actual fixes here:&lt;br/&gt;
1. Type EnumEqualityComparer`1 serialization issue: its object type ObjectEqualityComparer`1 is not ISerializable and should not be serialized.&lt;br/&gt;
Some explanation could be found here &lt;a href=&quot;http://dotnetstudio.blogspot.ru/2012/06/net-35-to-net-40-enum.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://dotnetstudio.blogspot.ru/2012/06/net-35-to-net-40-enum.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
2. HashSet and other generic collection deserialization issue for enum arrays: object array was not casted to enum array&lt;br/&gt;
3. EmptyObject serialization issues: typeid of such object were not passed to Grid (BinaryProcessor)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Several tests were added for all issues.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt; please review the changes&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
